{"slug":"contagious-effects","name":"Contagious Effects","description":"A Minecraft Fabric mod that enables status effects to spread between nearby players. Features configurable range, cooldowns, player state filtering, and in-game configuration via ModMenu.","author":"Inchutter","icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9VyAu31M/7ff3cb46df5df3d2694a114e62c65f6ee78aba88_96.webp","download_count":12,"supported_versions":[{"name":"1.21.11","channel":"release"}],"supported_loaders":[{"id":"fabric","name":"Fabric"}]}